  "description": "观澜 · 落子深度研判预案 — the sealed single-stock deep chain: pv.price_action + pv.technical + pv.microstructure + text.news evidence and text.sentiment feed a one-round dec.bull <-> dec.bear debate (turn order bull, bear; the bear answers the bull's BullCase through opponent_case) whose judge is dec.pm, the sole reasoner_deep seat; dec.pm's PortfolioDecision reaches the single terminal dec.trader (PortfolioTargetProposal@1). text.sentiment and dec.research_mgr are structural, not decoration: dec.pm REQUIRES sentiment and research_plan and they are their only producers. The evidence and debate nodes are auxiliary because the sealed catalog has no input on the pm/trader chain that accepts BullCase/BearCase and a reducer's DebateTranscript is invisible to Phase 1's dependency schema check — the debate binds to its judge through DebateCfg.judge_node_id and its turns are folded into the shared transcript slot by debate.transcript_reducer; wiring the folded transcript into the judge's model request is Phase-9 data-method work, exactly as the reviewed Phase-8 e2e states for itself. The graph is code-agnostic and byte-frozen: no node carries params, so one record digest serves every stock and one ApprovalLease binds it — the subject enters as a committed RunSubject@1 artifact, run-scoped beside the plan.",
